{"4951830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Horse Spirit Valley 2", "steam_appid": 4951830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ride into the Valley</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horse Spirit Valley 2 is a peaceful open-world horse adventure. Gallop across rolling meadows, autumn woods, winter frost, lilac dusk and emerald night — five distinct worlds waiting for your next ride.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend wild horses, collect sparkling gems, and build the stable of your dreams in the Horse Boutique. Soft exploration, beautiful nature, and the freedom to ride wherever the trail leads.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4951830/extras/06f6bddb09d8e67a5dc7c0e4de788594.poster.avif?t=1788244519\" width=460 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4951830/extras/06f6bddb09d8e67a5dc7c0e4de788594.webm?t=1788244519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4951830/extras/06f6bddb09d8e67a5dc7c0e4de788594.mp4?t=1788244519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Five Worlds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level has its own mood, light and terrain:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meadow— sunlit hills, wildflowers and open trails</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Autumn Forest— warm earth, birch trees and golden light</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winter Frost— snowy fields under a quiet sky</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lilac Dusk— soft evening colours and calm paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emerald Night— deep forest atmosphere after dark</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new worlds in the shop, select your favourite, and ride straight into it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4951830/extras/72d6d013d301333bbb5c22849176722e.poster.avif?t=1788244519\" width=460 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4951830/extras/72d6d013d301333bbb5c22849176722e.webm?t=1788244519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4951830/extras/72d6d013d301333bbb5c22849176722e.mp4?t=1788244519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tame &amp; Ride</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wild horses roam the valley. Approach gently, earn their trust, and welcome them into your stable. Switch mounts in the Horse Boutique — your friends are always waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4951830/extras/c6e762840d6fdbb6d5c3bea4e327793f.poster.avif?t=1788244519\" width=460 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4951830/extras/c6e762840d6fdbb6d5c3bea4e327793f.webm?t=1788244519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4951830/extras/c6e762840d6fdbb6d5c3bea4e327793f.mp4?t=1788244519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Horse Boutique</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make every horse your own:</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coats and spirit colours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mane styles and mane colours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Saddles and reins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horns and size options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your collection of tamed horses</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try looks on a live preview, buy with gems, and save the style you love.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect, Discover, Relax</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather gems across the valley</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the compass to points of interest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture beautiful moments with Photo Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with keyboard or gamepad</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pause when the Steam Overlay opens or a controller disconnects</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4951830/extras/76384c103659a2ed300c5ed7ff00d296.poster.avif?t=1788244519\" width=460 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4951830/extras/76384c103659a2ed300c5ed7ff00d296.webm?t=1788244519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4951830/extras/76384c103659a2ed300c5ed7ff00d296.mp4?t=1788244519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Steam Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Overlay support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller-friendly controls</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Quiet Adventure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No rush. No combat. Just you, your horse, and a valley full of light, wind and open ground. Wishlist Horse Spirit Valley 2 and come ride with us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ride into the Valley</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horse Spirit Valley 2 is a peaceful open-world horse adventure. Gallop across rolling meadows, autumn woods, winter frost, lilac dusk and emerald night — five distinct worlds waiting for your next ride.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend wild horses, collect sparkling gems, and build the stable of your dreams in the Horse Boutique. Soft exploration, beautiful nature, and the freedom to ride wherever the trail leads.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4951830/extras/06f6bddb09d8e67a5dc7c0e4de788594.poster.avif?t=1788244519\" width=460 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4951830/extras/06f6bddb09d8e67a5dc7c0e4de788594.webm?t=1788244519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4951830/extras/06f6bddb09d8e67a5dc7c0e4de788594.mp4?t=1788244519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Five Worlds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level has its own mood, light and terrain:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meadow— sunlit hills, wildflowers and open trails</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Autumn Forest— warm earth, birch trees and golden light</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winter Frost— snowy fields under a quiet sky</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lilac Dusk— soft evening colours and calm paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emerald Night— deep forest atmosphere after dark</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new worlds in the shop, select your favourite, and ride straight into it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4951830/extras/72d6d013d301333bbb5c22849176722e.poster.avif?t=1788244519\" width=460 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4951830/extras/72d6d013d301333bbb5c22849176722e.webm?t=1788244519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4951830/extras/72d6d013d301333bbb5c22849176722e.mp4?t=1788244519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tame &amp; Ride</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wild horses roam the valley. Approach gently, earn their trust, and welcome them into your stable. Switch mounts in the Horse Boutique — your friends are always waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4951830/extras/c6e762840d6fdbb6d5c3bea4e327793f.poster.avif?t=1788244519\" width=460 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4951830/extras/c6e762840d6fdbb6d5c3bea4e327793f.webm?t=1788244519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4951830/extras/c6e762840d6fdbb6d5c3bea4e327793f.mp4?t=1788244519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Horse Boutique</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make every horse your own:</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coats and spirit colours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mane styles and mane colours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Saddles and reins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horns and size options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your collection of tamed horses</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try looks on a live preview, buy with gems, and save the style you love.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect, Discover, Relax</